title: Node_AutoIntro
---
<<declare $shipper_stage = 0>>
Narrator: Welcome to the dorm.
Narrator: Talk to the shipper NPC when you are ready.
===

title: Node_NPC_Shipper_Interact
---
<<if $shipper_stage == 0>>
Shipper: Hey, I have a package for you. Can you confirm your student ID?
<<set $shipper_stage = 1>>
<<elseif $shipper_stage == 1>>
Shipper: Still waiting for that confirmation. Please verify through the official portal.
<<set $shipper_stage = 2>>
<<else>>
Shipper: Good choice. Always verify before sharing personal info.
<<endif>>
===
